### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "firstName": "Andrzej",
  "lastName": "Nowak"
}
### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

